{"component_id_namespace":"ec077a53-0b40-5f21-b1fe-a62094d2476b","component_schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","components":[{"attributes":{"code":"TMC","legacy_node_id":"ks-topeka:tmc:12.20.010","page_type":"section"},"citation":"12.20.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.20.010","content_hash":"3c3e75a5307545936df36eb656cd4bb0e07e34fb4a83dc5e672a38cbb3e94271","heading":"Definitions.","ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":null,"schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.20.010:section","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.20.010","text":"The following words, terms and phrases, when used in this chapter, shall have the meanings ascribed to them in this section, except where the context clearly indicates a different meaning:\n“Structure” means fences, signs, monuments, benches, large stones and any other items of personalty or realty.\n“Traffic Engineer” shall mean the Traffic Engineer for the City of Topeka or designee.\n“Vegetation” means and includes trees, shrubs, bushes, vines, grass or other vegetation. (Ord. 19407 § 1, 4-13-10. Code 1995 § 130-551.)\nCross References: Definitions generally, TMC 1.10.020 .","type":"section","workbench_component_id":"352cd43b-e9b8-5260-9e89-0af169889611"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"12.20.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.20.010","content_hash":"5c0d162fbb972f59649a6e460c42d2fe7d099c2a41298b3b0fb65b74bc4eacb1","heading":null,"ordinal":0,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.20.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:12.20.010:block:0","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/12.20.010","text":"The following words, terms and phrases, when used in this chapter, shall have the meanings ascribed to them in this section, except where the context clearly indicates a different me